# Cleanup probe (test only)

This file is not a tutorial. `test/nx_quantum/livebooks_test.exs` runs it to prove that the test harness stops leftover supervisors and purges the modules cells define. It lives outside `examples/livebook/`.

```elixir
Mix.install([{:nx_quantum, path: "../.."}])
```

A module defined by a cell:

```elixir
defmodule Probe.Thing do
  def answer, do: 41
end
```

A supervisor with a named Agent, left running on purpose:

```elixir
children = [%{id: Probe.Counter, start: {Agent, :start_link, [fn -> Probe.Thing.answer() end, [name: Probe.Counter]]}}]
{:ok, supervisor} = Supervisor.start_link(children, strategy: :one_for_one, name: Probe.Supervisor)
```

```elixir
# checkpoint: probe_state
%{agent_value: Agent.get(Probe.Counter, & &1), supervisor_alive: Process.alive?(supervisor)}
```
